fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"audio/gstaudiochannels.html#gst_audio_reorder_channels_with_reorder_map","fragment":"\n\tgst_audio_reorder_channels_with_reorder_map\n\n\n\tGstAudio.prototype.audio_reorder_channels_with_reorder_map\n\n\n\tGstAudio.audio_reorder_channels_with_reorder_map\n\nReorders data with the given reorder_map.\nThe reorder map can be retrieved for example with\ngst_audio_get_channel_reorder_map.\nNote: this function assumes the audio data is in interleaved layout\nParameters:\nThe pointer to\nthe memory.\nThe size of the memory.\nThe number of bytes per sample.\nThe number of channels.\nThe channel reorder map.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReorders data with the given reorder_map.\nThe reorder map can be retrieved for example with\nGstAudio.prototype.audio_get_channel_reorder_map.\nNote: this function assumes the audio data is in interleaved layout\nParameters:\nThe pointer to\nthe memory.\nThe size of the memory.\nThe number of bytes per sample.\nThe number of channels.\nThe channel reorder map.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nReorders data with the given reorder_map.\nThe reorder map can be retrieved for example with\nGstAudio.audio_get_channel_reorder_map.\nNote: this function assumes the audio data is in interleaved layout\nParameters:\nThe pointer to\nthe memory.\nThe size of the memory.\nThe number of bytes per sample.\nThe number of channels.\nThe channel reorder map.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});